                                        "entry_id": "cca96c90-55bf-3c7c-94c9-fc3d8bbce16e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prejudiced against women; misogynistic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a01f78b-01d9-479a-ab71-4f5a404c2435",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1488f9-d534-3a89-8e4d-d69deec9cc21",
                                                "text": "Val Glaser, the board member behind the 10-3 vote (with three abstentions) to quash the poster, told Windy City Times: \"Playboy is antiwomen and thus antilesbian."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "717215ce-65bc-4662-9b67-42d1e288ddfb",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1488f9-d534-3a89-8e4d-d69deec9cc21",
                                                "text": "13 years have passed from when we first started this labeling exercise and clearly, by anybody's definition, the music today is more violent, more hateful, more antiwomen than before — and these are top Billboard chart records."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9969f2f7-b5d3-4b64-8d9d-d14fc8900f27",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1488f9-d534-3a89-8e4d-d69deec9cc21",
                                                "text": "The show did not adequately condemn such violence and it carried a commercial that was also antiwomen. The women's community was upset about this show and the commercial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
