                                                "sense_id": "06f636b7-b8fd-3bf2-8f0a-63e05c317733",
                                                "text": "That Megawati Sukarnoputri has been labeled an antiwoman president has little to do with religion. Among other things, she voted not to ratify a provision that 30 percent of people voted to parliament should be women."
